  "description": "OLE-ACCESS as projected by ADO: on 'SELECT ID, ID, Code AS Dup, Code AS Dup, Txt FROM Items' ask Fields.Item for ordinals 0, 4, 5, -1, 999, names ID, id, Dup, NoSuch and empty, and Null, Empty, a Double 1.0, the string \"1\", an Integer 2 and a Boolean as the index (Name, Type and Value of each); then Properties.Item with -1, 999, an empty name and an unknown name, Errors.Item(0) on an empty collection, Parameters.Item on a Command without parameters, Fields.Item on the closed Recordset, and the field names of a join with repeated column names. Asks which indexes bind, which fail and with what errors.",
